{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2017/05/14/6963435/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スイカで沖縄石垣島竹富島\n行って来ました～～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5人で行く予定が\n急遽純奈はお仕事で来られなくなり、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てぃちゃんもお仕事で\n途中で先に帰りました(っ﹏-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2017/05/14/6963435/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もカメラ係として\nたくさん写真撮ったよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一眼と、fr100♡\n一眼は普段ディズニーでしか使わないから\n可愛い被写体が3人もいて\n撮るの楽しかったー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てぃちゃんもゆっちゃんも\nたくさん撮ってたから\n写真ありすぎて！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スイカの写真集のオファー\nお待ちしてます。ってくらい(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"動画もたくさんあるんだけど\nどこかで流せないかなー。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の旅のテーマは「暇」(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"予定もあんまり入れずに\nのんびーり過ごしたよ(*´-`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"基本的にずーっと食べてたかな。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2017/05/14/6963435/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったりのんびり\nでもわちゃわちゃできて\nとーっても楽しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"純奈も含めて5人でお揃いの\nグラスも買ったし(*´-`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2017/05/14/6963435/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちが行った三日間は快晴で\n夜空の星もとっても綺麗でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の日から梅雨入りだったみたいで\nスイカの晴れ女パワー炸裂！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またみんなでどこか行きたいな～～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2017/05/14/6963435/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上想い出日記でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}